tags buck dc-dc regulator
# Placement rules: 4/5 on the left, 1/2/3/8 on the right, 7 on top, 6/9 on bottom; pin connection points sit 2.54 outside the body edge.
# Same-side pins follow natural pin-number order: right side bottom to top 1, 2, 3, 8; left side bottom to top 4, 5; bottom side left to right 6, 9.
# Body width is the 2-pin/side minimum 5.08, body height the 4-pin/side 10.16; body width is widened to 25.4 to leave clearance for long pin
# names like VSENSE and for the vertical pin names of GND/PAD below (still multiples of 1.27).
